# Version bump requires changelog

If `package.json` `"version"` is being bumped or was bumped in this session:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/version-bump-changelog/SKILL.md`
2. Run `pnpm changelog:since` (add `--from <prev>` if needed)
3. Prepend a Keep a Changelog section to `CHANGELOG.md` matching the new version

Do not ship a version bump without a changelog entry.
